    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "交通方式（Dawarich 推断，非实测）",
      "description": "⚠️ 这些模式**不是我们测出来的**：collect_phone.py 只是把 Dawarich /tracks 返回的 mode_timeline 里的 emoji 翻译成名字。Dawarich 那一层按 GPS 点的速度和加速度**推断**，在地铁里必然出错 —— 地下没有 GPS，点稀疏又漂移，实测一段纯地铁通勤被判成了 driving + walking + cycling 三段。所以这张图只说明「Dawarich 这么认为」，不代表事实。要知道真实路线，看上面的地图。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 22
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "frser-sqlite-datasource",
        "uid": "lifelogging-sqlite"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "frser-sqlite-datasource",
            "uid": "lifelogging-sqlite"
          },
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawQueryText": "SELECT value_text AS '方式', ROUND(SUM(value_num),0) AS '分钟', COUNT(*) AS '段数' FROM events WHERE domain='location' AND metric='transport' GROUP BY value_text ORDER BY 2 DESC",
          "queryType": "table"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
