    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "geomap",
      "title": "地点地图（最近一天轨迹 + 近 30 天停留）",
      "description": "折线是手机上报的**原始 GPS 轨迹**（每天一条 location/track_path 事件，存在 meta_json.path 里，最多 500 个点）。底图用 OpenStreetMap 的公开瓦片：我们的坐标是 WGS-84，和高德/百度的 GCJ-02 差着约 500 米，换成国内底图点会整体偏移。⚠️ 底图必须写**显式 XYZ 地址**，不能用面板里那个内置的「OpenStreetMap」选项 ——新版 Grafana 内置底图走的是 Stadia，没 key 会满屏「API KEY REQUIRED」水印。⚠️ 瓦片是浏览器直接去公网取的，断网/被墙时地图是空的，但面板不会报错。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "frser-sqlite-datasource",
        "uid": "lifelogging-sqlite"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "frser-sqlite-datasource",
            "uid": "lifelogging-sqlite"
          },
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawQueryText": "SELECT json_extract(meta_json,'$.lat') AS lat, json_extract(meta_json,'$.lon') AS lon, value_text AS place, ROUND(value_num,0) AS minutes FROM events WHERE domain='location' AND metric='visit' AND day_local >= date('now','+8 hours','-30 days') ORDER BY ts_utc DESC",
          "queryType": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "frser-sqlite-datasource",
            "uid": "lifelogging-sqlite"
          },
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawQueryText": "SELECT CAST(json_extract(p.value,'$[0]') AS REAL) AS lat, CAST(json_extract(p.value,'$[1]') AS REAL) AS lon FROM events e, json_each(json_extract(e.meta_json,'$.path')) p WHERE e.domain='location' AND e.metric='track_path' AND e.day_local = (SELECT MAX(day_local) FROM events WHERE metric='track_path') ORDER BY p.key",
          "queryType": "table"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
